item._postman_note:
"Progress Tracker" tab for a single project.

Returns:
  project{leadId,projectName,jobId}
  taskProgress{completed,inProgress,pending,total,completedFraction,completedPct}
  timeline{plannedCompletion (Lead.endDate), currentEstimate, status: On Track|Delayed|Unscheduled}
  milestones[]{milestoneId,title,status,targetDate,completedAt}

Test script auto-saves the first milestone's id to {{milestoneId}}.

